+- one configuration with `<k>`, `<args>`, `<env>`, `<functions>`, and
+  `<result>`;
+- all 22 administrative K items from `start`, `exec`, and `eval` through the
+  for/while/if, expression-list, binary/comparison, subscript, `doLen`, and
